			<td style="width: 664px;" valign="middle">08.08.1907</td>
		</tr>
		<tr class="greybox" valign="middle">
			<td style="width: 638px;" valign="middle"><strong>Biggest Success</strong></td>
			<td style="width: 664px;" valign="middle">Promotion to Bundesliga 2010/2011, DFB-Pokal Semifinalist 2009/2010, Participant of UEFA Europa League 2015/2016</td>
